            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Trump Media's Q3 loss, Microsoft eyes longest sell-off since 2011",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks Friday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Sweetgreen (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SG\">SG</a>) stock is plunging after the company cut its full-year outlook.</p>\n<p>Trump Media (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DJT\">DJT</a>) reported a bigger third quarter loss than last year in the same period.</p>\n<p>Microsoft (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSFT\">MSFT</a>) stock is on track to reach its longest sell-off since 2011.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
